oving through the pharmacy. Alongside packing prescription orders, you’ll sometimes help coordinate prescriptions to ensure they progress smoothly through the process. You’ll need to be comfortable working at pace, staying organised and supporting your colleagues to meet daily targets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>What You’ll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pack prescription orders carefully and accurately, ensuring orders are complete and ready for dispatch.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assemble boxes and prepare prescriptions for shipment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support with prescription coordination, helping to track and organise orders as they move through the pharmacy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with colleagues across the pharmacy team to keep orders progressing efficiently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain a clean, organised and efficient workspace.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Follow procedures and instructions carefully, with a strong focus on accuracy and attention to detail.</p></li></ul><h3>What We’re Looking For</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A reliable, organised and detail-oriented individual.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Someone who can follow instructions and work accurately in a fast-paced environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A team player who enjoys practical, hands-on work and supporting colleagues.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Someone comfortable switching between packing tasks and occasional prescription coordination.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">No previous pharmacy experience required – full training will be provided!</p></li></ul><h3>What We Offer</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Full Training:</strong> Learn on the job in a supportive team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Full-tim