rritory plan focused on new logo acquisition, identifying and prioritising the manufacturing organisations with the greatest potential</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Generate your own pipeline through proactive outreach, including cold calling, social selling, events and executive networking</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Break into new accounts and build relationships from first contact through to signed contract</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the full sales cycle for new business, from prospecting and discovery to negotiation and close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Achieve or exceed quarterly and annual new business targets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead with insight, bringing a point of view on how automation can solve specific challenges such as supply chain disruption, order-to-cash delays, quality and compliance demands, and workforce shortages</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build compelling business cases that show the financial and operational value of UiPath to new buyers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with local partners and global systems integrators to source new opportunities and access new accounts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with marketing, business development and pre-sales teams on campaigns and plays that create new pipeline</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track competitors, market trends and industry priorities to spot new opportunities before others do</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hand over new customers smoothly to Customer Success and Customer Engineering, setting them up for successful implementation and long-term growth</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Share what works with fellow sales executives to strengthen the team’s hunting approach</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Explore ways of incorporating automation into daily work</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What yo