317">Conduct interviews and workshops with senior business, operations and technology stakeholders.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Facilitate discussions to gather requirements, validate findings and build consensus.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Present recommendations confidently to Executive Directors, Managing Directors and senior programme sponsors.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Collaborate across multiple teams and geographies to drive alignment.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Business Analysis &amp; Transformation Delivery</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Gather and analyse information from SMEs, documentation and existing processes.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Assess operational workflows, manual interventions, control environments and technology impacts.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Support prioritisation of initiatives based on business value, investment requirements and delivery dependencies.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Help define transformation opportunities and associated business cases.</span></p></li></ul> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Required Experience:</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Essential</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Significant experience within Financial Services Consulting, Strategy, Transformation or Change Management.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Proven experience designing and implementing Target Operating Models.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Strong operations transformation experience within large banking environments.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Exceptional executive communication and strategic storytelling capabilities.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Strong PowerPoint development and executive presentation skills.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience engaging and influencing senior stakeholders at Director, MD or C-suite level.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Excellent workshop facilitation and stakeholder interviewing experience.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Strong analytical and business analysis skills.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience developing transformation roadmaps and business cases.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ability to work independently within small, high-performing teams.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Preferred</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience within Payments, Transaction Banking, Operations or Wholesale Banking environments.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Understanding of operational risk, process optimisation and organisational design.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Familiarity with Lean, Six Sigma, process mapping and continuous improvement methodologies.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience supporting large-scale strategic transformation programmes.<br><br></span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why Join Delta Capita?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Work on a high-profile transformation programme within a leading global banking environment.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Exposure to senior executive stakeholders.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Opportunity to shape strategy and operating model decisions with measurable business impact.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Collaborative consulting environment focused on solving complex financial services challenges.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><