isted development tools (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, or similar): code generation, refactoring, debugging, and codebase exploration. Ability to craft effective prompts and leverage AI tools to accelerate delivery while maintaining code quality.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Backend (Ruby on Rails)</strong></p><ul><li><p>Design, development, and maintenance of Ruby on Rails applications and RESTful APIs (including Grape). Strong focus on clean architecture, scalable patterns, performance, and performance.</p></li><li><p>Experience with testing (RSpec), code reviews, continuous integration, and technical documentation.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Frontend (React)</strong></p><ul><li><p>Development of modern web interfaces in React with TypeScript and JSX. Experience with state management (Redux, Zustand) and component-driven architecture. Proficiency with Tailwind CSS and component libraries such as shadcn/ui. Strong UX sensitivity and attention to user experience.</p></li><li><p>Experience setting up and maintaining tests (Jest, React Testing Library, Cypress), and contributing to long-term maintainability</p></li></ul><p><strong>Data & Storage</strong></p><ul><li><p>Strong SQL skills with experience writing complex analytical queries. Familiarity with Snowflake is a plus but not required. Experience with environments mixing SQL (MySQL) and NoSQL (MongoDB/Mongoid), and performance/caching tools such as Redis and Elasticache.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Quality & Delivery</strong></p><ul><li><p>Strong engineering discipline: automation and tooling with GitHub, CI/CD (GitHub Actions), testing, linting (ESLint), and structured review processes. Experience working with cloud and scalable environments (AWS).</p></li></ul><p><strong>About you</strong></p><ul><li><p>You have 3+ years of experience with Ruby on Rails and React with TypeScript.</p></li><li><p>You're pragmatic and autonomous, able to take a feature from design to production.</p></li><li><p>You have strong SQL skills and ex