ps with clients and suppliers</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Manage supplier contracts</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Serve as contact person for clients regarding operational matters</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Operations</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Deliver services to customers according to contract/SLA</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Set operational objectives and standards</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ensure efficient planning and administration within operational processes, set priorities</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Monitor processes, work instructions, quality, quantity, and continuity of service</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Participate in multidisciplinary projects as project manager</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Monitor SLAs, intervene/escalate when necessary</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Quality</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Achieve quantitative and measurable quality objectives (KPIs)</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Minimize damages</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Responsible for 5S quality methodology within the department</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Maintain order and cleanliness in the workplace</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Report KPIs using Balanced Score Card/Management By Facts</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Reporting</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Report financial and operational performance to the Site Manager</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ensure proper administrative processing in the WMS</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Report on inventory management (accuracy and control of physical/system inventory)</span></p></li></ul><p><