strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">At Qualinx, we believe that great work starts with a great environment, pioneering technology and a fun dynamic market to address. Here’s what you can expect when you join our team:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ownership and Impact</strong>: We offer employee equity, giving you the opportunity to share in the success you help create.</p></li><li><p><strong>Well-being Matters</strong>: Your physical and mental health are important to us. We provide access to wellness resources, including company discounts and a free mental healthcare platform.</p></li><li><p><strong>Global Talent, Local Support</strong>: If you're relocating from abroad, we provide full support throughout the visa process to ensure a smooth transition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Future-Focused Benefits</strong>: We contribute to your pension savings to help you plan ahead with confidence.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Inspiring Workspace</strong>: Work from a modern and vibrant, well-equipped office designed to help you do your best work.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Scale-up Team Spirit</strong>: We celebrate our wins together with fun quarterly events—think great food, games, and unforgettable experiences.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/qualinx/senior-communication-system-engineer-delft-296666","tags":[],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Delft, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792323078},{"slug":"senior-gnss-software-architect-principal-gnss-engineer-delft-353033","company_name":"Qualinx","title":"Senior GNSS Software Architect / Principal GNSS Engineer","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><em>Join our cutting-edge start-up adventure!</em></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Who are we?</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p clas