redefining what it means to work in deep tech.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW41210993 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW41210993 BCX8"><strong>Job Description</strong>&nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Define and own the end-to-end GNSS receiver software architecture, including acquisition, tracking, measurement engine, navigation, and positioning stack.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Lead architectural decisions for low-power, high-performance GNSS chipsets, balancing performance, power, and silicon constraints.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Translate product requirements into scalable, modular, and maintainable software architectures.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Drive design trade-offs across algorithm complexity, hardware acceleration, and system constraints.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Design and optimize advanced algorithms for: GNSS acquisition and tracking (multi-constellation, multi-frequency), Positioning, navigation, and timing (PNT), Multipath mitigation and interference suppression, Snapshot and ultra-low-power GNSS techniques<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Lead development of next-generation techniques such as: Assisted GNSS (A-GNSS), Hybrid positioning (GNSS + Wi-Fi/Bluetooth/IMU), LEO-PNT and emerging navigation paradigms<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Oversee implementation of GNSS algorithms in embedded C on RTOS / bare-metal systems, FPGA with focus on performance optimization, high-volume silicon deployment<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Mentor and guide engineers, contractors in GNSS algorithms and embedded development. Set technical direction and promote engineering best practices, design standards and lead technical reviews, architecture discussions, decision-making processes.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Cross-Functional collaboration with product management to shape feature roadmap and differentiation strategy. Present technical concepts and results to internal and external stakeholders, including leadership teams and customers.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Job requirements</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Must haves</strong><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Qualinx is looking for a result-driven and conscientious GNSS Engineer. Someone who thrives in an environment where your proactive and can-do attitude is highly appreciated. The ideal candidate for this role must have:<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Master’s or PhD in Electrical Engineering, Signal Processing, or related field.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">10+ years of experience in GNSS, wireless communication systems, or signal processing.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Proven track record in GNSS system design and product development.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Deep understanding of the GNSS signal processing chain, including:<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle2 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Acquisition, tracking, measurements, and navigation<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Strong expertise in:<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle2 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Embedded C/C++ development on RTOS or bare-metal platforms<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle2 SCXW259387030 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">MATLAB and Python for modelling and algorithm development<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul clas