er continues to grow.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000"><br></span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Are you interested in joining a highly successful, fast-growing technology company that brings the world to our customers' fingertips? If so, don't hesitate to apply!</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000"><br></span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Working model:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Hybrid <br></span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Hours:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> 32 - 40 hours per week<br></span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We are looking for an Internal Communications Specialist who will develop and deliver clear, engaging and timely communication across our global organization. You will help employees understand our strategy, priorities and changes, while bringing our culture and values to life through strong internal communication.<br></span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Working closely with leaders and teams across the business, you will create content and communication that connects people, supports change and helps turn business priorities into action.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000"><br></span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you'll do</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Develop and deliver our internal communications strategy, creating a clear communication approach and rhythm that brings our business strategy, priorities, culture and values to life for our people.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Translate business priorities and organizational change into clear and engaging communication, helping employees understand where we are going, what it means for them and how they contribute.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Create compelling content and campaigns across our internal channels, from leadership messages and company updates to employee stories, organizational announcements and culture initiatives.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Enable leaders to communicate effectively, supporting the CEO and leadership teams with key messages, town halls, talking points and communication around change or sensitive topics.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Own and continuously improve our internal communication channels and key employee moments, ensuring communication is timely, consistent and relevant across countries, functions and teams.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Strengthen culture and engagement through communication, working closely with the wider People team to reinforce our values, desired behaviors and employee experience.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Listen and measure impact, using employee feedback, engagement insights and communication data to understand what is landing and continuously improve our approach.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Partner with Marketing where internal and external communication connect, including employer branding and supporting the CEO’s LinkedIn communication.<br></span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you bring</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF">ing</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">5+ years of experience in internal communications, employee engagement or a related communications role.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience developing and executing internal communication strategies in an international or multi-location organization.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Strong writing and storytelling skills, with the ability to turn complex business topics into clear, engaging and human communication.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience with change communications and confidence working with senior leaders and cross-functional teams.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A creative eye and strong visual communication skills, with the ability to bring messages and campaigns to life.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A data-driven mindset, using employee feedback, engagement insights and communication analytics to understand impact and improve.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A hands-on, proactive approach — comfortable moving from strategy to execution and making things happen.<br><br></span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">What we offer</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A challenging role in a strong, growing international company</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A team of more than 500 talented and helpful colleagues from many different countries</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Room for personal growth through training, courses and coaching</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A company phone and laptop</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Holidays:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> 25 days, with the option to buy 10 extra days per year, plus an additional day off after Ascension Day</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Mental Health Day:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> one flexible day per year to rest, recharge and focus on your wellbeing</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Sports allowance:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> €25.00 gross per month</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Home-working allowance:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> €2.00 per day, based on our hybrid way of working (3 days in the office, 2 from home)</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000"><br>Interested?</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">If this role sounds like you, we'd love to hear from you! Apply via the button below with your CV</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/cyclomedia-technology/senior-internal-communications-specialist-zaltbommel-119373","tags":["HR"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Zaltbommel, Gelderland, Netherlands","created_at":1792312289},{"slug":"account-executive-uk-utrecht-277886","company_name":"Channable","title":"Account Executive UK","description":"<p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are the core driver of Channable’s growth in your region. Alongside your team members in the UK market, you are developing and closing new business opportunities with online retailers and marketing agencies. You are successful, because of your strong industry knowledge, marketing domain expertise and the special way of making the prospect uncomfortable in their current situation -</p><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">without Channable. You share what you learn and grow others with your insights. </p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>This is an individual contributor role, and you’ll report to <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chantall-bebb-a69a2b131/">Chantall</a>. </p><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Your Job</strong> </p><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">Full-cycle Account Executive building pipeline and closing deals from start to finish. You understand the buying process for B2B and how this impacts you as a seller. In the era of the dark social we don’t have to tell you to build your personal brand, align with marketing and work together to attract the right people.</p><ul><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Hitting the number:</em> Showing ownership and consistency in hitting your numbers</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Product expert:</em> You showcase a deep understanding of our product and the Multichannel eCommerce space. Your prospects understand the impact of technology on their day to day as well as their organisation through your</p><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">storytelling.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Deal cycle:</em> Connecting and holding strategic discussions at all levels with different stakeholders in an organisation helps you drive various deal cycles and ACV ranges to success.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">Pipeline: Driving pipeline generation and target achievement from partner agencies, brands, and advertisers.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Be in market:</em> Planning and attending industry events such as exhibitions, trade fairs, roundtables, webinars, as well as AE or partner dinners and on-site training sessions.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Personal brand:</em> Facilitate your own personal brand in educating your prospects and the wider social media community. Deliver value to your audience building your own inbound stream through thought leadership and authority. </p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><strong>What Success Looks</strong></p><ul><li><p class="p2" style="text-align:start;"><em>Target Achievement:</em> Consistently meet or exceed your MRR targets each quarter. Provide thoughtful insights on your performance and results.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Accountability:</em> You own your pipeline, stay proactive, and keep momentum going. Sharing your moves, ideas and wins.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><em>Care to Share</em>: Actively share your learnings and successes across teams, industry / product knowledge with partner agencies or trade fairs, and online via LinkedIn (personal brand building).</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p class="p1" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Who are you?</strong> </p><ul><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are in sales because you are self motivated and driven to succeed. You understand sales is playing the long term game. All the nos in your career led to you being humble and you understand that for you to win it means you need to help your prospects reach their goals.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You have a strong eCommerce or marketing agency background with a relatable network.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are a top performer in an inside/mid-market sales role with 1+ years experience closing new logos. SaaS experience is a bonus but not required.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are naturally curious and have a history of learning new things quickly. You facilitate people around you to learn from in the same way that you give back to others.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are tech-savvy, a user of CRMs, sales engagement platforms and other toolings which makes your job easier.</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You facilitate information you distill from reporting to drive your focus and number-driven learnings. </p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are a native or fluent English speaker</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Other requirements/ some practical things we expect from you:</strong></p><ul><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You’re available for at least 4 days a week (32 hours);</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You are willing to come to our Utrecht office for two days/week;</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You have a valid work permit for the Netherlands or EU citizenship;</p></li><li><p class="p1" style="text-align:start;">You live in (or close to) Utrecht, or are willing to move // You live in the Netherlands</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Who are we?</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Being part of our team means working with diverse and fun people who trust and help you along the way. Channable was founded in 2014 in the heart of Utrecht. We are now a strong team of 320+ diverse individuals, more than +40 nationalities, and a brand new and vibrant HQ in Utrecht, serving customers all over the globe. We're also operating from other offices including New York City,&nbsp;Berlin, and Aarhus.</span><br><br><span style="color:#121317">Joining Channable means you’re looking for a bit more than just a job. We like spending time with each other. Be that in the office, our Channabar, or in one of our internal chats. We’re open-minded and down-to-earth people. We’re super proud that everyone adds their own special spice to Channable’s culture. Diverse as we are, we all share our love for growth, to help, to take ownership, and create an awesome journey together. Feel free to take a further look at our&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.instagram.com/wearechannable/">Instagram</a></u><span style="color:#121317">,&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/channable/">Facebook</a></u><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/channable/mycompany/?viewAsMember=true">LinkedIn</a></u><span style="color:#121317">! Give our&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://heyzine.com/flip-book/b03da65c24.html">Culture Playbook</a></u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://online.fliphtml5.com/qtfug/wxhm/#p=1">&nbsp;</a><span style="color:#121317">a read.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure style="text-align:start;"><iframe height="281" width="500" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/-AIRo81tV5E"></iframe></figure><h4 style="text-align:start;"></h4><h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong>What do we do?</strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Channable is a fast-growing B2B SaaS platform that offers a fully integrated way to market your products online. We empower marketers and online businesses to manage, scale, and optimize their marketing.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#000000">What we offer</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">The salary ranges from €3.677 to €4.307 gross per month (70%) based on a 40-hour workweek, within a clear career &amp; salary structure. </span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#121317">Your OTE (On Target Earnings) consists of 70% gross base salary according to the indicated level and 30% commission (paid out quarterly). </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#121317">Example: If the monthly gross salary is €4.000 (70%), the monthly bonus is €1.714 (30%), resulting in a total monthly package (OTE) of €5.714 gross.</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">8% holiday allowance - 8% of your yearly salary, which is paid together with the May salary.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Annual L&amp;D budget of € 1000 to spend on anything you want to learn. You can take full advantage of this to grow professionally.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Saving for old age - we have a saving scheme for old age which can accrue up to 5% of your monthly salary.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Traveling to our office? No problem, we got you covered. (NS Business Card, or €0,25 per km if you decide to use a different means of transport) 🚆</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Our beautiful, fully renovated historic office in central Utrecht offers a hybrid working policy, requiring just two days in the office per week.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Since you can work from home, we will provide home office supplies. 🖥️⌨️</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">26 vacation days + 2 reload days based on 40 hours.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We offer a 3-week-long workcation; and an additional 3 weeks, if you live as an expat in the Netherlands! 🍹</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Having flexible working hours means starting your day between 8.00 - 10.00 am. 🕰️</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We want you to feel good - please feel free to use our discounted&nbsp;Urban Sports Club&nbsp;subscription.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You have free &amp; anonymous access to the OpenUp platform and psychologists. This free service is also available to your family members.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Are you going to become a parent? We think it is important that you spend time with your newborn. Enjoy 5 weeks of 100% paid partner leave!</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">At Channable, our Chef and Commis Chef prepare fresh meals Monday to Thursday, catering to all dietary needs - including vegan, vegetarian, and gluten-free - to keep our team fueled and inspired! T</span><span style="color:#323338">o round out the week, Fridays feature delicious ordered-in sandwiches and salads. </span><span style="color:#121317">Or, you can go to the city center to get the lunch of your choice.</span></p></li><li><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7472609865060978688/"><span style="color:#7148BD">Channaweekend</span></a><span style="color:#121317"> - Every year we go for a long weekend with all our colleagues from all over the world 💜🔥</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Additional working conditions like massages, in-office bar (Channabar), parties, even personal training sessions at our Channagym, video games, and many more!</span></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong>How can you introduce yourself to us?</strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#000000">Are you interested? Please apply by clicking on the "apply now" button below. Please send your application in English.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317"><span style="background-color:#F5F5F5">I</span>nterview steps:</span></p><ol><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">If it's a match, our Talent Acquisition Specialist will get in touch with you for an introduction call (25 minutes).</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">After that, you’ll be invited for an online interview with </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chantall-bebb-a69a2b131/"><span style="color:#121317">Chantall</span></a><span style="color:#7148BD"> </span><span style="color:#121317">(60 minutes).</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Next, you'll have an assignment interview at our office with </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chantall-bebb-a69a2b131/"><span style="color:#121317">Chantall</span></a><span style="color:#121317">  and </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ievalauridsen/"><span style="color:#121317">iEva </span></a><span style="color:#121317">(60 minutes). And , you’ll have a lunch/coffee chat with the team members (30 minutes). </span>☕</p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Please note that after the interviews, and before the offer stage, we’ll conduct reference checks.</span></p></li></ol><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">We consider applications as they come in!</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="font-size:0.9em"><span style="color:#121317">Contact by job agencies and recruiters will not be appreciated. Each recruiter or headhunter who approaches us agrees with a donation of </span></span><span style="color:#121317">$</span><span style="font-size:0.9em"><span style="color:#121317">250 for Make-A-Wish.</span></span></em></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="font-size:0.9em"><span style="color:#121317">At Channable, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration. We believe in diverse and inclusive teams.</span></span></em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/channable/account-executive-uk-utrecht-277886","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792312289},{"slug":"senior-customer-success-manager-benelux-utrecht-196710","company_name":"Channable","title":"Senior Customer Success Manager Benelux","description":"<p><span style="color:#000000">Channable is a fast-growing B2B SaaS platform driving digital commerce across the globe. By offering a fully integrated solution, we empower marketers, online stores, and digital agencies to manage, scale, and optimize their online activities.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">As the market leader in the Benelux, we owe our success to an incredible product, a passionate team ánd our customers who love working with us! To keep winning, our Benelux region is split into two specialized teams (Strategic and Growth), working closely together.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u><span style="color:#000000">This opening is within the CS Benelux Strategic team.</span></u><span style="color:#000000"> </span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:justify;"><strong><span style="color:#000000">Your role in a nutshell:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> you'll own Channable's most strategic Benelux relationships: (inter)national brands with digital marketing teams in the region, and our biggest Agency Partners (Gold &amp; Silver). You'll work with senior specialists, marketing leads, heads of e-commerce, and decision-makers to understand what their business is trying to achieve this year and how their digital marketing team is measured against it. From there, you find where Channable can drive the outcomes that get them closer to those goals. When your clients win, and Channable is a part of that, we grow together, and that growth is yours to own. </span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Here's what that looks like day-to-day:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000">Business-goal alignment and planning: understanding each client's and/or agency's annual objectives and how their digital marketing team contributes to them, then translating that into a strategic success plan with outcomes both sides can measure.</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000">Stakeholder management &amp; multi-threading: building and maintaining relationships across the whole account, from hands-on specialists to executive sponsors, so no relationship rests on a single contact.</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000">Strategic cadence: kick-offs, Impact Reviews, realizing success plans with outcome-driven and goal-focused metrics, check-ins, demos, hosting trainings, and commercially led meetings, online and onsite, in the market.</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000">Portfolio &amp; account ownership: retention, expansion and net new MRR across a named set of top-tier accounts; identifying risk early, preventing churn and downgrades; pipeline creation and forecasting.</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000">Voice of the customer: running trainings and enablement for large advertisers and partner teams, feeding client insight back to product and commercial, and turning your strongest accounts into webinars, success stories and references.</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000">Raising the bar: contributing to how we manage the strategic segment, account plans, risk signals, expansion playbooks, and Customer Success processes.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you bring:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have 3+ years' experience in Customer Success, Account Management, Partnership Management, or a similar client-facing commercial role, with a track record on large or complex accounts. Experience on the other side of the table, at a marketing agency or in-house at a brand, counts fully.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You build relationships across an organisation, from hands-on specialists to senior decision-makers, and you're willing to challenge a client when their plan won't get them where they say they want to go.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You've carried a commercial target, and you know how to plan towards it rather than hope for it.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You understand online marketing well enough to hold a credible conversation with a performance marketing lead.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Not a must, but a strong plus: experience on the client side, at a marketing agency or in an in-house digital marketing team (preferably e-commerce)</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have at least a completed HBO education - for example, in the direction of commercial economics, (international) business, marketing, or hospitality.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Your language skills include excellent written and spoken Dutch (C2)&nbsp; and English at a C1 level.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Other requirements:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are living in The Netherlands with travel distance from our Utrecht office.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are willing to come to our Utrecht office for 2 days/week, preferably more.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are available to travel and visit clients.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are available for at least 32 hours per week (4 days).</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have a valid work permit for the Netherlands or EU citizenship.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Not a must, but a strong plus: experience on the client side, at a marketing agency or in an in-house digital marketing team (preferably e-commerce)</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Who are we?</span></strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Being part of our team means working with diverse and fun people who trust and help you along the way. Channable was founded in 2014 in the heart of Utrecht. We are now a strong team of 320+ diverse individuals, more than +40 nationalities, and a brand new and vibrant HQ in Utrecht, serving customers all over the globe. We're also operating from other offices including New York City,&nbsp;Berlin, and Aarhus.</span><br><br><span style="color:#121317">Joining Channable means you’re looking for a bit more than just a job. We like spending time with each other. Be that in the office, our Channabar, or in one of our internal chats. We’re open-minded and down-to-earth people. We’re super proud that everyone adds their own special spice to Channable’s culture. Diverse as we are, we all share our love for growth, to help, to take ownership, and create an awesome journey together. Feel free to take a further look at our&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.instagram.com/wearechannable/">Instagram</a></u><span style="color:#121317">,&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/channable/">Facebook</a></u><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/channable/mycompany/?viewAsMember=true">LinkedIn</a></u><span style="color:#121317">! Give our&nbsp;</span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://heyzine.com/flip-book/b03da65c24.html">Culture Playbook</a></u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://online.fliphtml5.com/qtfug/wxhm/#p=1">&nbsp;</a><span style="color:#121317">a read.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure style="text-align:start;"><iframe height="281" width="500" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/-AIRo81tV5E"></iframe></figure><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">What do we do?</span></strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Channable is a fast-growing B2B SaaS platform that offers a fully integrated way to market your products online. We empower marketers and online businesses to manage, scale, and optimize their marketing.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">What do we offer?</span></strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">The OTE salary ranges from €3.650 to €5.000 gross per month based on a 40-hour workweek. OTE (On Target Earnings) consists of 80% gross base salary and 20% commission (paid out quarterly). A breakdown of this structure is provided below:</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p><u><span style="color:#121317">Base salary</span></u><span style="color:#121317">: The base salary is gross between €3.650 and €5.000 (80%) per month based on a 40-hour workweek. The salary is determined based on experience.</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><u><span style="color:#121317">Performance bonus</span></u><span style="color:#121317">: 20% performance bonus is gross between €915 and €1.250 (20%) per month based on a 40-hour workweek.</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">8% holiday allowance - 8% of your yearly salary, which is paid together with the May salary.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Annual L&amp;D budget of € 1000 to spend on anything you want to learn. You can take full advantage of this to grow professionally.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Saving for old age - we have a saving scheme for old age which can accrue up to 5% of your monthly salary</span><span style="color:#323338">, or you can get an additional +2.5% to your monthly base salary.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Traveling to our office? No problem, we got you covered. (NS Business Card, or €0,25 per km if you decide to use a different means of transport) 🚆</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Our beautiful, fully renovated historic office in central Utrecht offers a hybrid working policy, requiring just two days in the office per week.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Since you can work from home, we will provide home office supplies. 🖥️⌨️</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">26 vacation days + 2 reload days based on 40 hours.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We offer a 3-week-long workcation; and an additional 3 weeks, if you live as an expat in the Netherlands! 🍹</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Having flexible working hours means starting your day between 8.00 - 10.00 am. 🕰️</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We want you to feel good - please feel free to use our discounted&nbsp;Urban Sports Club&nbsp;subscription.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You have free &amp; anonymous access to the OpenUp platform and psychologists. This free service is also available to your family members.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Are you going to become a parent? We think it is important that you spend time with your newborn. Enjoy 5 weeks of 100% paid partner leave!</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">At Channable, our Chef and Commis Chef prepare fresh meals Monday to Thursday, catering to all dietary needs - including vegan, vegetarian, and gluten-free - to keep our team fueled and inspired! T</span><span style="color:#323338">o round out the week, Fridays feature delicious ordered-in sandwiches and salads. </span><span style="color:#121317">Or, you can go to the city center to get the lunch of your choice.</span></p></li><li><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7472609865060978688/"><span style="color:#7148BD">Channaweekend</span></a><span style="color:#121317"> - Every year we go for a long weekend with all our colleagues from all over the world. 💜🔥</span></p></li><li><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/channable_channable-channaweek-workculture-activity-7426540961326895105-EXff?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAASoXJgBHdq4CVsQCH0PpnYcTQNs3ymnPIk"><span style="color:#7148BD">Channaweek</span></a> <span style="color:#121317">- We believe in bringing people together. That’s why we organize global events like Channaweek where our entire international team gathers in Utrecht to connect and learn from one another.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Additional working conditions like massages, in-office bar (Channabar), parties, even personal training sessions at our Channagym, video games, and many more!</span></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">How can you introduce yourself to us?</span></strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Are you interested? Please apply by clicking on the "apply now" button below. Please send your application in English.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Interview steps:</span></p><ol><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">If it's a match, our Talent Acquisition Team will get in touch with you for an introduction call (25 minutes).</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">After that, you’ll be invited for an interview with </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/julessteultjens/"><span style="color:#7148BD">Jules</span></a><span style="color:#121317"> (your future team lead) &amp; one of the other team leads of the Customer Success department (60 minutes).</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Next, you'll have an assignment interview with Jules</span><span style="color:#7148BD"> </span><span style="color:#121317">(your future team lead) &amp; </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/iomichels/"><span style="color:#7148BD">Io</span></a><span style="color:#7148BD"> </span><span style="color:#121317">at our Utrecht office. You’ll also receive an office tour from your future team members (90 minutes).</span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Please note that after the interviews and before the offer stage, we’ll conduct reference checks.</span></p></li></ol><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">We consider applications as they come in. We look forward to hearing from you!</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="font-size:0.9em">*Contact by job agencies and recruiters will not be appreciated. Each recruiter or headhunter who approaches us agrees with a donation of €250 for Make-A-Wish.</span></em></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="font-size:0.9em">**At Channable, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration. We believe in diverse and inclusive teams.</span></em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/channable/senior-customer-success-manager-benelux-utrecht-196710","tags":["Customer Success"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792312289},{"slug":"director-research-development-amstelveen-331226","company_name":"Skyteam","title":"Director Research & Development","description":"<br><strong>Purpose of the job </strong><p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">The Director Research &amp; Development (R&amp;D) leads the exploration and development of potential business and technology initiatives, from initial ideation through feasibility analysis, testing, validation and proof of concept (POC)/prototyping. For assigned initiatives, the role coordinates the full exploration phase and develops substantiated proposals for consideration and approval by the relevant governance bodies.</span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"> </span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">The role requires a proactive, self-motivated approach, the ability to work independently and to manage multiple subjects concurrently. Initiatives may range from joint venture (JV) model enhancements and artificial intelligence (AI) to customer experience development and new approaches to distribution.</span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background:#FFFFFF;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"> </span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong>KEY RESULT AREAS/ KEY RESPONSIBILITIES</strong></span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background:#FFFFFF;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"> </span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong>Ideation and concept generation</strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:13.7px;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Ensure that potential initiatives align with SkyTeam’s strategic goals and assess their purpose, expected value, rationale and the implications of not proceeding.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Ask relevant questions and gather appropriate information to support well-founded recommendations and help build consensus among member airlines.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Organize and facilitate ideation and brainstorming sessions.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Monitor developments in the transport industry and at IATA to identify emerging trends and opportunities or gaps for improving existing legacy systems.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Generate, collect and develop ideas and concepts in partnership with member airlines and other contributors for marketable initiatives that could become SkyTeam priorities.</li></ul><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong>Exploration, feasibility and concept development</strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:17px;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Lead the exploration of assigned initiatives, including relevant research and data analysis, feasibility assessments, business cases, business requirements documents (BRDs) and POCs/prototypes, as appropriate.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Analyze business and technical challenges across different airline domains; identify and assess potential solutions and determine the most relevant product concept, design and feasibility approach.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Develop evidence-based recommendations, supported by tangible data and analysis, that demonstrate the potential business value of the proposed initiative.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Prepare proposals and supporting materials for review and approval by the relevant SkyTeam and member-airline decision-making bodies.</li></ul><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong>Stakeholder engagement and governance</strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:17px;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Work effectively within SkyTeam’s matrix organization and collaborate with member airlines, internal teams and relevant external contributors.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Engage with operational and technical stakeholders, including senior decision-makers, to understand requirements, assess options and build alignment around proposed concepts.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Support informed decisions through clear analysis and recommendations. Strategic prioritization and formal initiative approval remain with the Executive Board (EB), Strategy Committee (StratCom) and relevant governance bodies.</li></ul><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><strong>Transition to implementation</strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;margin-left:17px;"><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Following approval, coordinate with Digital/Delivery to transfer the agreed concept, supporting analysis, business requirements and relevant POC findings for MVP development and implementation.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Where assigned, act as project owner or coordinate relevant project activities within the agreed governance arrangements. Accountability for implementation transfers to Digital/Delivery.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:justify;">Budget, resource or external-partner responsibilities may be assigned depending on the approved initiative and are not standing responsibilities of the role.</li></ul></p><br><strong>Your profile</strong><p><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;display:inline;"><strong>REQUIRED SKILLS, KNOWLEDGE &amp; EXPERIENCE</strong></span><br><ul><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Strong airline-industry background, with demonstrated experience in core airline businesses such as PRM, distribution, operational research and e-sales.</li><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Broad understanding of airline business and technical domains, sufficient to assess a variety of potential initiatives.</li><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Good understanding of relevant technical aspects; experience in a Business Analyst role is an advantage.</li><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Excellent facilitation skills, with the ability to engage and guide diverse groups towards innovative solutions.</li><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to explain and present complex concepts and inspire teams.</li><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Analytical and critical-thinking skills, including the ability to evaluate complex options and communicate evidence-based recommendations.</li><li style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Ability to work independently on multiple subjects and collaborate effectively in a multicultural matrix organization.<br><br></li></ul><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;">Responsibilities and tasks of the position are not limited to the above mentioned, and deviations can occur at any point in time as the position evolves and in concert with the manager.</span><br></p><br><strong>Why us?</strong><p><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">SkyTeam will offer you a complete salary package that includes unique benefits:</strong></strong><br style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><br style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"></strong><ul style="border:0px solid;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">A challenging role </strong>at a unique employer in the Netherlands</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Salary:</strong> a competitive monthly gross salary depending on your experience</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Vacation pay</strong>: 8% of gross annual salary</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Vacation days:</strong> 27 vacation days for one year</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Birthday leave</strong>: additional PTO (1 day) on or around your birthday</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Public holiday exchange</strong>: exchange Dutch bank holidays with any bank holiday culturally significant to you</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Pension plan: </strong>everything you need for a good retirement</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Equipment:</strong> laptop, phone or e-sim</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Home office: </strong>create and equip your home office with our support.</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Travel allowance:</strong> travel allowance for public transport, bicycle, and car </li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Discounted travel: </strong>reduced airfares after 6 months of your start date</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Learning environment:</strong> free access to LinkedIn Learning, Lunch &amp; Learn sessions, and the opportunity to surround yourself with highly skilled colleagues</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Work from anywhere: </strong>flexibility to work from anywhere in the world (duration of max. four weeks)  </li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Hybrid way of working: </strong>we offer flexibility to work from home</li><li style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;"><strong style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;">Fun events:</strong> potluck parties, monthly after work get-togethers, annual summer/winter events, and more appealing team activities throughout the year</li></ul></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/skyteam/director-research-development-amstelveen-331226","tags":["Aviation","Director","Research & Development"],"job_types":["Executive","Temporary","Full time"],"location":"Amstelveen","created_at":1792300399},{"slug":"platform-engineer-den-haag-20425","company_name":"Job offers ID-ware","title":"Platform Engineer","description":"<br><strong>Job Description</strong><p>What keeps the services behind a security company online, day after day, with almost no downtime? At ID-ware, it is the Platform Engineering team. They build and look after the cloud systems that colleagues and clients rely on every day. <br> <br>As Senior Platform Engineer, you will lead the design, build and upkeep of our infrastructure on AWS and Azure using Terraform. You will keep it secure, reliable and scalable, and you will own solution architecture. You will work closely with the Platform team. <br><br><strong>What you will do </strong><br><ul><li><span><span>Lead the design, build and maintenance of ID-ware and client infrastructure in the cloud, managed in Terraform</span></span></li><li><span><span>Keep AWS and Azure infrastructure secure, reliable and scalable</span></span></li><li><span><span>Work with the Platform team to find and fix infrastructure issues at the root cause</span></span></li><li><span><span>Own solution architecture and respond to requests from colleagues who may have limited technical knowledge</span></span></li><li><span><span>Support internal operations in Azure and Entra, and customer-facing applications that run mostly on AWS</span></span></li><li><span><span>Take part in the on-call rotation for infrastructure that supports customer-facing applications</span></span></li><li><span><span>Support internal security audits and client assessments</span></span></li><li><span><span>Act on client feedback passed on by project managers, and contribute to new projects as directed by the Platform team manager</span></span></li><li><span><span>Provide guidance and best practices for using cloud services</span></span></li></ul> <br><strong>What success looks like </strong><br><ul><li><span><span>All AWS and Azure infrastructure </span><span>is</span><span> managed in Terraform, and is secure, stable and scalable</span></span></li><li><span><span>Incidents are resolved quickly at the root cause, and on-call work is handled reliably</span></span></li><li><span><span>Security audits and client assessments pass without major findings</span></span></li><li><span><span>The Platform team works to clear, consistent standards that you set and share</span></span></li><li><span><span>Project managers and colleagues see you as a credible technical partner</span></span></li></ul><br></p><br><strong>Your profile</strong><p><strong>Experience and education</strong><br><ul><li>Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or equivalent experience</li><li>5+ years of experience in a similar role</li><li>Fluent English</li></ul><br><strong>Technical skills</strong><ul><li>Experience designing solution architecture for cloud platforms</li><li>Expert proficiency in Terraform, including using and implementing it</li><li>Strong understanding of AWS and Azure services, and comfort working in both</li><li>Expert knowledge of Linux and Unix systems</li><li>Expert knowledge of identity and access management systems</li><li>Experience with cloud security best practices</li><li>Knowledge of how to make a product operationally ready</li><li>Expert knowledge in troubleshooting and diagnosing platform issues</li><li>Knowledge of databases</li></ul><br><p><strong>Ways of working</strong></p><ul><li>Clear and effective communicator, including with colleagues at all levels of the organisation</li><li>Proactive and self-motivated, and comfortable pushing objectives forward</li><li>Collaborative approach when working with the Platform team and project managers</li><li>Security-conscious approach to design</li><li>Patient and clear when explaining technical choices to colleagues with limited technical knowledge</li></ul> <br><strong>Nice to have </strong><br><ul><li><span><span>AWS certification, for example AWS Solutions Architect or AWS DevOps Engineer</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience developing APIs using Node.js or Python</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience with </span><span>Github</span><span> Enterprise and </span><span>Github</span><span> Actions</span></span></li><li><span><span>Working Knowledge of Jira Atlassian </span></span></li><li><span><span>Knowledge of SQL Server</span></span></li><li><span><span>Dutch language skills</span></span></li></ul></p><br><strong>What do we offer?</strong><p>You will join a growing, international company that is shaping the future of PIAM solutions, where Platform Engineering plays a key role in keeping 