l><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8">Je bent resultaatgericht, maar verliest de kwaliteit niet uit het oog. &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8">Je bent gedreven, slim, analytisch en bent in staat op verschillende niveaus te denken en te handelen. &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8">Je beheerst de Nederlandse en Engelse taal op professioneel niveau, mondeling en schriftelijk. Beheers je daarnaast ook nog Duits? Dan is dat de kers op de taart!&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"> &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong>Bij Intus hechten we veel waarde aan een informele, maar professionele werksfeer. Maar er is meer dat ons bijzonder maakt! Hier is ons DNA in een kort overzicht:</strong> &nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong><em>Trots; </em></strong>op ons product, onze klanten én onze collega’s!  &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong><em>Goede vibe; </em></strong><em>een gezellige</em> sfeer waar iedere mening telt.  &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong><em>Open cultuur;</em></strong> jazeker, met korte lijnen en weinig hiërarchie.  &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong><em>Collegialiteit; </em></strong>we helpen elkaar en hebben lol met elkaar. Heb je een last-minute vraag? Je vindt altijd iemand die wil helpen.  &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong><em>Ambitieus; </em></strong><em>w</em>at we tot nu toe hebben gedaan is geweldig, maar we zijn nog lang niet klaar!  &nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"> &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong>En verder bieden we:</strong>  &nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een goed salaris</em></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een </em><strong><em>zinvolle baan</em></strong><em>: deel uitmaken van een organisatie die het werkleven van 200.000 mensen gemakkelijker maakt</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><strong><em>Gratis lunch en fruit</em></strong><em>: we eten allemaal gezamenlijk als je op kantoor bent</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Verschillende </em><strong><em>ontwikkelingsmogelijkheden</em></strong><em>!</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Je kunt zowel bij de klant, op kantoor of thuis werken</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een leuk en gezellig kantoorgelegen naast station Driebergen-Zeist</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een </em>leaseauto of mobiliteitsbudget :) &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Onbelaste onkostenvergoeding </em><strong><em>(internet) van 30,-€/maand</em></strong> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een goede balans tussen werk en privéleven: je kunt ervoor kiezen om </em><strong><em>32 of 40 uur</em></strong><em> per week te werken</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een douche (een warme </em>😊)... zodat je met de fiets naar kantoor kunt komen of tijdens de lunch of na kantoortijd een stukje kunt hardlopen! &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>28 vakantiedagen om je batterij weer op te laden</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>€750,- </em><strong><em>thuiswerkbudget</em></strong><em> om een gezonde werkomgeving thuis te creëren</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Pensioenregeling</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Vrijdagmiddagborrel, bordspelen, darten, tafelvoetbal, jaarlijks teamuitje</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW37428671 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW37428671 BCX8"><em>Een</em><strong><em> jaarlijkse trip</em></strong><em>✨ met al je collega's!</em> &nbsp;</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/intus-workforce-solutions-bv/projectmanager-senior-driebergen-rijsenburg-475401","tags":["Consultancy"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Driebergen-Rijsenburg, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792290737},{"slug":"remote-senior-quality-engineer-tellent-intelligence-ai-amsterdam-295070","company_name":"Tellent","title":"Senior Quality Engineer - Tellent Intelligence (AI)","description":"<p><em>Note: The listed salary range is based on the salary range for the Netherlands. Salary ranges may vary by location.</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>About the Role</strong></h4><p>As a <strong>Senior Quality Engineer – Tellent Intelligence (AI)</strong>, you'll own and grow the quality of the AI-powered experiences built by our <strong>Tellent Intelligence</strong> team alongside our existing QE team. You'll help shape how we test applications powered by large language models (LLMs) and AI agents, ensuring they are reliable, safe, and deliver high-quality experiences for our customers.</p><p>You'll expand our end-to-end test coverage in Playwright and help build robust approaches for validating AI-powered systems, where quality extends beyond functional correctness. This is a hands-on, collaborative role with genuine ownership, direct impact on product development, and the opportunity to shape how we test AI at Tellent.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>Your 12-Month Journey</strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong>During your first 3 months:</strong> You'll get to know our <strong>Tellent Intelligence</strong> domain, engineering practices, AI-powered features, and quality standards. You'll learn our testing framework and development workflow while contributing to automated, exploratory, and AI-focused testing.</p></li><li><p><strong>Within 6 months:</strong> You'll take ownership of quality across key AI-powered features, expand our Playwright test coverage, and work closely with engineers to validate AI behaviour, prompts, and model-driven functionality throughout development.</p></li><li><p><strong>After 1 year:</strong> You'll be a trusted quality partner within the <strong>Tellent Intelligence</strong> team, driving improvements to our AI testing strategy, strengthening our automation framework, and helping shape how we build reliable, safe, and responsible AI experiences across Tellent.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>What You'll Be Doing</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Work closely with fellow Quality Engineers to bring our test automation strategy to life across the <strong>Tellent Intelligence</strong> domain, taking shared ownership and continuously improving it as our platform evolves.</p></li><li><p>Partner with developers, AI engineers, and fellow QEs to embed quality early in the development process, sharing knowledge and shaping testing practices collaboratively.</p></li><li><p>Design and execute comprehensive test plans, test cases, and automated test suites across frontend, backend, and AI-powered functionality.</p></li><li><p>Develop into a product domain expert, using your understanding to identify risks early and guide quality decisions across the <strong>Tellent Intelligence</strong> domain.</p></li><li><p>Design and execute testing strategies for AI-powered features, validating not only functional correctness but also the quality, relevance, consistency, and safety of AI-generated outputs.</p></li><li><p>Develop approaches for testing non-deterministic systems by creating evaluation datasets, defining quality benchmarks, and identifying hallucinations, bias, regressions, and prompt-related issues as models and prompts evolve.</p></li><li><p>Partner with engineers to validate prompt changes, AI agent behaviour, and safety guardrails, ensuring our AI behaves reliably and responsibly before reaching customers.</p></li><li><p>Continuously improve how we evaluate AI quality by helping establish best practices, quality metrics, and testing frameworks for LLM-powered applications.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>What You Bring</strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong>Strong QA experience:</strong> Several years of hands-on quality engineering, with senior-level ownership of testing for complex web applications.</p></li><li><p><strong>AI quality mindset:</strong> Experience testing AI-powered applications, LLM-based products, conversational AI, or machine learning systems is a strong plus. If you haven't worked directly with AI before, you're excited to learn and apply quality engineering principles to this rapidly evolving space.</p></li><li><p><strong>E2E automation:</strong> Experience building and maintaining end-to-end test suites in Playwright.</p></li><li><p><strong>API &amp; backend testing skills:</strong> Experience testing APIs and backend services.</p></li><li><p><strong>Balance of product and technical thinking:</strong> Equally at home discussing product behaviour and digging into technical detail.</p></li><li><p><strong>Understanding of AI testing challenges:</strong> Familiarity with concepts such as prompt engineering, AI agents, hallucinations, model bias, evaluation datasets, and AI safety principles is a plus.</p></li><li><p><strong>Analytical mindset:</strong> Comfortable defining quality expectations for systems where outputs may vary while still delivering a great user experience.</p></li><li><p><strong>Communication:</strong> Fluent English for daily collaboration. Polish is a plus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>What We Offer</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Hybrid or remote working setup across Amsterdam, the Cologne area, or Poland</p></li><li><p>A chance to shape one of the most ambitious scale-ups in Europe and lead a company-defining tech transition.</p></li><li><p>Work in a diverse, multicultural, and remote-friendly team.</p></li><li><p>€1,500 annual training budget + 2 dedicated learning days</p></li><li><p>Pension plan, travel reimbursement, and wellness perks.</p></li><li><p>28 paid holiday days + 2 additional days to relax.</p></li><li><p>Work from anywhere for 4 weeks/year.</p></li><li><p>Apple MacBook and top-tier tooling.</p></li><li><p>€200 home office budget.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Please note: Benefits may differ based on your employment location.</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>About Tellent</strong></h4><p>Tellent is a leading Talent Management Suite designed to empower HR &amp; People teams across the entire employee journey. Our all-in-one platform combines an Applicant Tracking System (<strong>Tellent Recruitee</strong>), an intuitive HRIS (<strong>Tellent HR</strong>), and powerful Performance Management software (<strong>Tellent Grow</strong>).</p><p>With 250+ team members globally, 7,000+ customers in 100+ countries, and a growing ecosystem of 500+ partners, we help organizations attract, grow, and retain top talent — and we’re just getting started.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>AI in our recruitment process</strong></h4><p>We use our internally developed AI tools to help streamline our recruitment process. However, technology never makes a decision. Every candidate is personally reviewed by our team. Your journey with us is guided by people, supported by tech. Curious about how it works? Read our&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://recruitee.com/ai-statement">AI Statement</a>, check our&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://recruitee.com/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, or chat with us at&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>If you require accommodations or support during the recruitment process, please let us know — we’re happy to help.</em></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/tellent/remote-senior-quality-engineer-tellent-intelligence-ai-amsterdam-295070","tags":["1. R&D","Remote"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1792290737},{"slug":"devops-engineer-iam-ping-am-ds-idm-rotterdam-227024","company_name":"Swisscom","title":"DevOps Engineer IAM (Ping AM/DS/IDM)","description":"<p><strong>DevOps Engineer IAM (Ping AM/DS/IDM)</strong></p><p>You'll shape our IAM for the future with Ping Identity platforms. With deep technical expertise and a sense of architecture, you'll shape Swisscom's security promise to our customers. You'll also contribute hands-on to engineering.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>What impact will you have?</strong></p><p>The department is organized according to agile principles in a SAFe value stream. The value stream currently consists of three ARTs, each with experts of different backgrounds and levels of maturity. We cultivate a culture of curiosity with transparent communication and flat hierarchies. You will be a reliable point of contact for technical questions regarding the Ping Identity Platform in the value stream.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Must-haves:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Experience with <strong>Ping/ForgeRock Identity Management Solutions (AM/DS/IDM)</strong></p></li><li><p>Proficiency with cloud-native technologies (containerization with Docker, orchestration with Kubernetes, Linux/Unix)</p></li><li><p>Experience with programming on the JVM (Java, Groovy or any other languages)</p></li><li><p>Strong sense of ownership, accountability, and responsibility</p></li><li><p>Reliable, Self-Motivated and solution-oriented mindset</p></li><li><p>Eager to learn and share experience with team members</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Nice-to-haves:</strong></p></li><li><p>CI/CD automation experience (GitLab or similar)</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with modern monitoring, observability, and security frameworks</p></li><li><p>Understanding of working in an agile environment and delivering incremental value</p></li></ul><p><strong><br>Want to know more about us?</strong></p><p>We are serving the Swiss market as Switzerland’s leading IT &amp; Telecom company. Thus, we are actively driving digitalization and networking, and tapping new paths for our customers and our employees. Our values are spark passion, aim high and stand true.</p><p>Since 2019, we have been building up the coolest DevOps Center with a wonderful office at the World Trade Center in the heart of Rotterdam. We are currently recruiting IT passionate professionals who are keen on developing high-quality software, have an agile mindset and appreciate the collaboration with motivated colleagues from all over the world.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>What's in it for you?</strong></p><p><em>Work environment</em></p><ul><li><p>Agile way of working, multi-cultural work environment promoting work-life balance</p></li><li><p>Autonomy, flexibility, opportunity and growth</p></li><li><p>Cool office space in the World Trade Center Rotterdam!</p></li><li><p>Are you coming to the office by bike or car? You can park right here at the office</p></li><li><p>Be a part of our events to build a stronger Swisscom community - for example, culture lunches, fun quizzes, game nights and a lot <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/swisscom-devops-center-rotterdam/posts/?feedView=all">more!</a></p></li></ul><p><em>Allowances</em></p><ul><li><p>Full relocation support (Housing, settling in, etc.) for you and your family</p></li><li><p>200 euros per month Telephone/internet allowance</p></li><li><p>275 euros per month contribution to health insurance</p></li><li><p>5 Paid training days and access to Swisscom learning platforms</p></li><li><p>Travel allowance reimbursement</p></li><li><p>500 euros home office allowance</p></li><li><p>Gym subscription, Tax advice, and language course</p></li><li><p>Salary range: 60,000 to 70,000 euros gross per year including holiday allowance</p></li></ul><p><em>Leaves policy</em></p><ul><li><p>Work from abroad possibility for one month per year</p></li><li><p>Care, bereavement, maternity and paternity leaves</p></li><li><p>25 days paid vacation days plus Dutch national holidays</p></li></ul><p><em>Contract terms</em></p><ul><li><p>To begin with you will receive a fixed term contract (one year), after 6 months of your employment with us, after a feedback meeting with the team, there is a possibility of extending the contract&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>The salary ranges mentioned in our Job Descriptions are base annual gross salaries including the 8% holiday allowance</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/swisscom/devops-engineer-iam-ping-am-ds-idm-rotterdam-227024","tags":["IAM - Identix"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792290737}],"links":{"first":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=1","last":null,"prev":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=1","next":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=3"},"meta":{"current_page":2,"current_page_url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=2","from":101,"path":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api","per_page":300,"to":300,"terms":"This is a free public API for jobs, please do not abuse. I would appreciate linking back to the site. By using the API, you agree to the terms of service present on Arbeitnow.com","info":"Jobs are updated every hour and order by the `created_at` timestamp. Use `?page=` to paginate. Read more information here: https://www.arbeitnow.com/blog/job-board-api"}}

{"data":[{"slug":"customer-service-advisor-berlin-146819","company_name":"iwoca Deutschland","title":"Customer Service Advisor","description":"<h2>The company</h2><p>Small businesses move fast. Opportunities often don’t wait, and cash flow pressures can appear overnight. To keep going, and growing, SMEs need finance that’s as flexible and responsive as they are.</p><p>That's why we built iwoca. Our smart technology, data science and five-star customer service ensures business owners can act with the speed, confidence and control they need, exactly when it's needed.</p><p>We’ve already cleared the way for 100,000 businesses with more than £4 billion in funding. Our passionate team is driven to help even more SMEs succeed, through access to better finance and other services that make running a business easier. Our ultimate mission is to support one million SMEs in their defining moments, creating lasting impact for the communities and economies they drive.</p><h2>The role</h2><p>Customer Service Advisors are the first point of contact for potential customers as well as new and existing customers, and thus the “face” of iwoca. You handle incoming calls, emails and web chats, supporting entrepreneurs with general inquiries, new applications and repeat loans. You highly value our customer service and support customers with your excellent communication skills so they can successfully utilise our products.</p><p>A fundamental component for our success is to convince and inspire customers and partners of our mission - this ranges from hair salons and dental practices to financial advisory services and banks.</p><h2>The requirements</h2><p>Essential:</p><ul><li>Demonstrates curiosity to use and learn more about AI tools. You’ll already be comfortable using AI tools in practical ways to help solve problems, increase productivity and improve quality of work, showing good judgement about when to use them and the ability to explain the reasoning behind that use.</li><li>We look for people who are smart, humble, motivated and always looking to improve.</li><li>You enjoy communicating with customers and live "customer centricity". Your greatest motivation is achieving success with our customers.</li><li>You have completed a commercial training / business studies (kaufmännische Ausbildung / betriebswirtschaftliches Studium) and can add value with relevant professional experience in customer service (experiences in the banking environment or a fintech are a plus).</li><li>You are highly motivated, organised, a true team player and have a 'hands-on' mentality.</li><li>You possess C1-level German communication skills (both written and spoken) and are comfortable collaborating in English within our diverse, international office.</li><li>An independent, team-oriented and reliable way of working is a given.</li></ul><p>Don’t take this list as prescriptive: it’s just to give you a sense of who might do well at the job. We’d still love to hear from you if you don’t hit every point on the list, or if you have other experience.</p><h2>Your mission:</h2><p>You are responsible for the overall customer satisfaction and ensure that customer inquiries via phone, email or web chat are handled promptly and efficiently.</p><p>You answer questions about our products, the application process and our service in general, supporting both new and existing customers.</p><p>You assist entrepreneurs in completing their applications and providing the necessary documents required for a credit decision.</p><p>You collaborate with various teams within iwoca to achieve the best outcome for our customers.</p><p>You proactively participate in the development of iwoca by providing regular insights on customer feedback, opportunities to improve our processes or new offerings from our competitors.</p><p>Work-life balance is incredibly important at iwoca and we offer flexible working so you can make better use of your free time. This is a hybrid role in which you can split your time between the office and home.</p><p>We want to make iwoca a place where everyone feels welcome, where you can confidently be yourself. We understand that inclusivity, and diversity that comes through greater inclusivity, isn't an optional add-on; it's the core ingredient of what makes us great. We care about making iwoca a healthy and happy community for all of our team members to thrive in.</p><h2>The salary</h2><p>We expect to pay from €30,000 — €38,000 for this role. But, we’re open-minded, so definitely include your salary goals with your application. We routinely benchmark salaries against market rates, and run quarterly performance and salary reviews.</p><h2>The culture</h2><p>At iwoca, the best idea wins. We model our culture on independent thinking, challenging untested logic, and evidence-based decisions. We prioritise learning and growth, and give people the autonomy to develop in the direction that makes them most effective.</p><p>We're a tech company and believe in the power of AI to help us work faster and better. We provide the infrastructure where every iwocan always has access to the best models and where those models have access to all of our data. We will help our people to learn how to use and grow with the new tools available to them.</p><h2>The offices</h2><p>We put a lot of effort into making iwoca a great place to work:</p><p>Offices in London, Leeds, Berlin, and Frankfurt with plenty of drinks and snacks.</p><p>Events and community-led groups, including running groups, padel, and monthly ping-pong and pool competitions.</p><h2>The benefits</h2><p>A smart, motivated and international team (we represent over 35 different nationalities) with ridiculous growth-mindset.</p><p>26 days of vacation a year plus a free day for your birthday.</p><p>One-month fully paid sabbatical after 4 years.</p><p>Mental health support with direct access to certified psychologists via our partner OpenUp.</p><p>iwoca takes over a ski chalet in winter so that you and your team can ski or snowboard (and work) for a week. During summer we are drawn to the sun. We’ve been to France, Italy, Spain, and further afield.</p><p>Access to the gym membership program, €25 for either Fit711 or Urban Sports Club.</p><p>€30 contribution towards the Deutschlandticket.</p><p>Company Pension with Canada Life.</p><p>Great office locations. In Frankfurt in the middle of the city, our Berlin office is located in Prenzlauer Berg.</p><p>A paid volunteer day that gives you the opportunity to invest time to support a charity of your choice.</p><p>Corporate Benefits discounts.</p><p>’iwocans’ also benefit from fully stocked fridges in our offices with whatever is needed to strengthen them. There are snacks (both healthy and less healthy) for the whole day.</p><p>And to make sure we all keep learning, we offer:</p><p>A learning and development budget for everyone, including a book budget.</p><p>Learning German budget.</p><p>Company-wide talks with internal and external speakers.</p><p>Access to learning platforms like Treehouse.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/iwoca-deutschland/customer-service-advisor-berlin-146819","tags":["Customer Service"],"job_types":["Permanent employment (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","professional / experienced"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792474236},{"slug":"interesse-an-admkrs-munich-272257","company_name":"ADMKRS GmbH","title":"Interesse an admkrs? (m/w/d)","description":"<h2>Deine Mission</h2>
<p><strong>Kurz vorab:</strong> Wir schreiben hier keine Stelle aus. Diese Seite ist für Leute, die admkrs kennen, unsere Arbeit verfolgen und einen konkreten Grund haben, warum sie genau hier hingehören. Wenn das auf dich zutrifft, lies weiter. Wenn du gerade an zwanzig Agenturen dieselbe Bewerbung schickst, ist das hier nicht der richtige Ort.</p>
<p>Du sagst uns, welche Lücke du bei uns schließt. Nicht wir dir. Wir sind rund 20 Leute in München, arbeiten für Marken wie ESN, arena und asambeauty an Performance-Kampagnen, Creatives, Video und eigener Technologie. Vieles davon ist öffentlich sichtbar: unsere Cases, unsere Creatives, unsere Tools. Schau dir das an und sag uns, wo du andocken würdest und was dadurch bei uns besser wird.</p>
<h2>Dein Profil</h2>
<ul>
<li>Du hast dir admkrs angeschaut und kannst in drei Sätzen sagen, warum wir und nicht irgendeine Agentur.</li>
<li>Du hast ein Fachgebiet, in dem du richtig gut bist: Performance Marketing, Creative und Design, Video und Motion, Strategie oder Entwicklung.</li>
<li>Du zeigst Arbeit statt Buzzwords. Ein Link zu Projekten, Creatives, Code oder Kampagnen sagt uns mehr als jedes Anschreiben.</li>
<li>Du lebst in München oder bist gerade dabei, hierher zu ziehen. Wir arbeiten zusammen im Office am Gärtnerplatz, dafür muss dein Lebensmittelpunkt hier sein.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Warum wir?</h2>
<ul>
<li>Kurze Wege: Strategie, Design, Video und Performance sitzen an einem Tisch, Feedback kommt in Minuten statt in Tagen.</li>
<li>Kreative kennen die Zahlen, Media Buyer die Ideen. Wir entwickeln Arbeit gemeinsam weiter.</li>
<li>Eigene Technologie: Unser Entwicklerteam baut Tools, KI-Skills und Schnittstellen für den Alltag. Was fehlt, bauen wir selbst.</li>
<li>Ein Office, in das man gern kommt, mitten in München.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Darauf schauen wir</h2>
