0 people work there, fully remote, across more than 100 countries and 74 languages. Deel reached $1B in annual revenue in just over five years and is valued at $17.3B. It’s pre-IPO and growing fast.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role</strong><br />You’ll join the Website team, which looks after <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://deel.com">deel.com</a> and every landing page behind it. For most future customers, the website is their first impression of Deel, and this team makes sure that impression turns into a conversation. You’ll be at the centre of Deel’s conversion work: designing, testing and shipping the pages that turn visitors into pipeline. You’ll own tricky, high-stakes problems on Deel’s busiest pages, from the first hypothesis through the A/B test to the shipped design.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own conversion on the website and landing pages from start to finish. Spot opportunities yourself instead of waiting for a brief.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Write a clear problem statement and success metric, then design, prototype and launch A/B tests quickly. Keep what works and let go of what doesn’t.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring strong visual and UI craft to every page, and keep each launch on-brand and consistent with the design system.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with growth, performance marketing and sales to understand what the business needs, then turn it into pages that speak to the customer’s real problem rather than internal jargon.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use storytelling, in words and visuals, to introduce new products, launches and offers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and ship experiments together with growth PMs, engineers, data analysts and lifecycle marketers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design landing pages for new product and feature launches with product marketing.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set the bar for craft and careful experimentation, and give other designers thoughtful feedback.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you need to succeed</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">8+ years in product design, with a portfolio that shows you owning web design end to end.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with CRO, A/B testing and experimentation. You’re comfortable talking about hypotheses, test design, statistical significance and iteration.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent craft and UI skills. Your portfolio shows polished web and landing page work that actually converts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A genuine growth mindset: every launch is a chance to learn something.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong storytelling and a feel for visual hierarchy that guides a visitor toward action.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re at home in analytics and experimentation tools such as Amplitude or GA, and you use both numbers and user insight to make decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience taking a web experiment or launch from idea all the way to design QA.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You explain your work clearly to designers and to business stakeholders alike.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building and maintaining a design system for a marketing site.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you get</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Direct impact on the first thing most prospects see of Deel.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stock grants at a pre-IPO company, depending on your role, employment status and location.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully remote work, plus an optional flexible office membership with IWG.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong design team to learn from.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/hirehire/remote-senior-product-designer-growth-website-deel-422078","tags":["Product Design"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1792464018},{"slug":"remote-staff-product-designer-growth-deel-327661","company_name":"Hirehire","title":"Staff Product Designer - Growth | Deel","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Role:</strong> Staff Product Designer, Growth<br /><strong>Company:</strong> Deel<br /><strong>Location:</strong> Fully remote<br /><strong>Job type:</strong> Full-time</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Deel</strong><br />Deel is an all-in-one payroll and HR platform for global teams. It covers HRIS, payroll, compliance, benefits and equipment for every type of worker in 150+ countries. About 7,000 people work there, fully remote, across more than 100 countries and 74 languages. Deel reached $1B in annual revenue in just over five years and is valued at $17.3B. It’s pre-IPO and leans heavily into AI. Each designer works with about five engineers, and AI has made the team much faster this year.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role</strong><br />Growth at Deel doesn’t follow a fixed roadmap. The team works from a queue of ideas: lots of CRO experiments and bigger growth bets. On some projects you’ll own the design from start to finish. On others you’ll set the direction and keep the quality high without building a full prototype yourself. Everything you work on ties back to activation, engagement, retention and revenue.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead design across growth projects and connect each one to the numbers that matter: activation, engagement, retention and monetisation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design, prototype and A/B test quickly, together with product, engineering, data and marketing.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the Deel UI team on the design system, including motion, animations and micro-interactions that make growth flows feel good.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spot where users or the team get stuck, and fix it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay close to your engineers from first idea to design QA, and keep the team moving.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentor product designers and help improve how the team works day to day.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you need to succeed</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5–7 years in product design, including 2+ at Staff level.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real growth design experience. Onboarding flows, pricing pages, subscriptions or virality features are a great sign.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent craft, and a portfolio that makes people say “wow”. It needs at least one case study.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re comfortable with experiments and data: you form hypotheses, run A/B tests and show measurable results. Amplitude, Mixpanel or similar tools feel familiar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is the first tool you reach for, before Figma or a doc. If you have AI work in your portfolio, we’d love to see it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’d rather build than talk about building. You enjoy moving fast and don’t mind figuring things out as you go.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You communicate clearly and bring people with you, across product, engineering, data and marketing.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can ship your own work to production, for example through the frontend repo, Claude Code or internal tools.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Personal projects you’re proud of.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you get</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High-impact growth work at a pre-IPO company, with stock grants depending on your role and location.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully remote, async-friendly work, plus an optional flexible office membership with IWG.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong design team to learn from, and a clear career ladder.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fair pay based on your skills and experience. Deel never asks about your salary history.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/hirehire/remote-staff-product-designer-growth-deel-327661","tags":["Product Design"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1792464018},{"slug":"remote-senior-staff-product-designer-ai-deel-425222","company_name":"Hirehire","title":"Senior Staff Product Designer - AI | Deel","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Role:</strong> Senior Staff Product Designer, AI | Deel<br /><strong>Company:</strong> Deel<br /><strong>Location:</strong> Fully remote<br /><strong>Job type:</strong> Full-time</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Deel</strong><br />Deel is an all-in-one payroll and HR platform for global teams. It covers HRIS, payroll, compliance, benefits and equipment for every type of worker in 150+ countries. About 7,000 people work there, across more than 100 countries and 74 languages. Deel reached $1B in annual revenue in just over five years and is valued at $17.3B. It’s pre-IPO, and AI is at the centre of where it’s heading next.</p><p style="min-height