 a product with a proven result, and you can walk us through the whole story: the problem, the research, the prototype, the launch and the outcome.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent craft, and a portfolio that makes people say “wow”. It needs at least one case study.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is the first tool you reach for, before Figma or a doc. You follow new releases and actually use them in your work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You think in systems, and you’re comfortable working with ML engineers on error states and confidence thresholds.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You enjoy moving fast and don’t mind figuring things out as you go.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can ship your own work to production.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience applying behavioural science to AI products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A background in payroll, HR, fintech or compliance, or personal projects you’re proud of.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you get</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The chance to shape how AI works across a pre-IPO global platform, with stock grants depending on your role and location.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully remote, async-friendly work, plus an optional flexible office membership with IWG.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong design team to learn from, and a clear career ladder.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fair pay based on your skills and experience. Deel never asks about your salary history.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/hirehire/remote-senior-staff-product-designer-ai-deel-425222","tags":["Pr