h moments are digital, which are personal, and which are both. Together with RM and Sales leadership you design seamless handovers, a shared view between client app and RM workspace, and service tiers that scale high-touch quality to more clients without diluting it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Complex Offerings, Made Simple: </strong>Make sophisticated products understandable and executable: private markets with capital calls, distributions and J-curves, and the underlying funds and companies, from Cinven and Advent to Mistral and Databricks, as well as bespoke mandates, company and holding accounts, family structures and consolidated reporting across portfolios. You work closely with the Investment team, Compliance and Operations so every journey is compliant by design.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Discovery, Data &amp; Experimentation: </strong>Join advisory meetings, shadow RMs and run continuous discovery with clients for whom every interaction matters. You combine qualitative depth with rigorous measurement in a small-n, high-value segment, define tracking schemas for client and RM journeys, and use AI-assisted prototyping to converge on solutions in few iteration cycles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Thought Leadership with Hands-on Mentality: </strong>Act as Product Manager and Product Owner for a cross-functional team of Engineering, Design and Product Ops. You drive adoption of what you ship inside the RM organization, prioritize transparently by impact and effort – which also means saying no – and grow into the thought leader for hybrid wealth management at LIQID.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>What you bring</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Background:</strong> 7+ years in Product Management, ideally in wealth management, private banking, FinTech or another trust-driven, advice-led domain. Experience building for internal expert users such as advisors, sales or service teams alongside end clients is a strong plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Service Design &amp; Hybrid Thinking: </strong>You think in service models, not just screens. You have designed journeys that span people, processes and software, and you know how to drive adoption and behavior change inside an organization, not only ship features to it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Domain Depth &amp; Regulatory </strong>Fluency: Solid understanding of investing and wealth management (capital markets, private markets, portfolio construction), and the ambition to build regulatory fluency in a supervised environment (MiFID II, BaFin). Experience with private market products or advisory processes is a strong plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Analytical &amp; Technical Fluency: </strong>You define metrics before you build and attribute impact credibly, even with small samples. You are comfortable with CRM and workflow integrations, discussing architecture and API trade-offs with engineers, and using AI tooling to prototype and to build AI-assisted workflows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Communication &amp; Language: Fluent in German and English</strong>, with the presence to earn credibility with experienced Relationship Managers and with clients who expect the highest standard – and to represent your roadmap toward leadership.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive &amp; Motivation: </strong>Comfortable in fast-paced, high-ownership scale-up environments. You want to own outcomes, not backlogs, and you are excited to define what a premium hybrid private client experience looks like in an AI-native product organization.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What we offer</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Diversity</strong>: Flat hierarchies and cultural openness make you an integral part of our 