e, this isn’t it.</p><p>If you enjoy <strong>building, selling, and scaling something from the ground up</strong>, with no politics and just growth opportunities, you’ll love it here.</p><h2>Your responsibilities</h2><p><strong>Own revenue generation</strong></p><p>• Generate pipeline through outbound and inbound channels</p><p>• Lead discovery calls and pitch our services to mobile companies</p><p>• Close deals for our Performance Ads division (CPI/A), across OEM ads, Ad Networks, Programmatic, and rewarded traffic.</p><p><strong>Run the full sales cycle</strong></p><p>• Prospect → qualify → pitch → negotiate → close</p><p>• Manage deals end-to-end</p><p><strong>Build the sales engine</strong></p><p>• Help refine our sales playbook</p><p>• Develop scalable outbound strategies</p><p>• Turn successful sales motions into repeatable frameworks</p><p><strong>Work directly with the founders</strong></p><p>• Help shape our commercial positioning</p><p>• Influence new business opportunities and markets in which to scale activities</p><p><strong>Represent the company</strong></p><p>• You will be joining industry events and potentially represent the company with speaking engagements.</p><p>We are building the team from the ground up. If you enjoy selling, building strategies, and getting things done, then we are looking for you.</p><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><p>5+ years of experience selling <strong>mobile app marketing or Mobile-related services in a SaaS company is a must</strong></p></li><li><p>Proven track record of closing mid- and high-ticket deals</p></li><li><p>Strong understanding of the mobile ecosystem (UA channels, attribution, ROAS, LTV, SKAN, MMPs)</p></li><li><p>Experience running full sales cycles independently</p></li><li><p>Strong entrepreneurial mindset</p></li><li><p>Comfortable with outbound prospecting</p></li><li><p>Business-fluent English is a must (any additional European language is a plus)</p></li><li><p>Must have previous agency experience</p></