nd digital ecosystems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Revenue Performance and Forecasting:</strong> Consistently <strong>hit and exceed ambitious revenue targets</strong> with pipeline rigor, accurate forecasting, and a results-driven mindset.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We Are Looking For Requirements</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Proven track record in sponsorship sales</strong>, ideally within <strong>B2B media, events, or community led businesses</strong>, not just ad sales or programmatic.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable owning and growing <strong>large accounts with six-figure deal sizes</strong>, with the commercial instinct to spot upsell and cross-sell opportunities across a portfolio of products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Equally strong at hunting new business as they are at deepening existing relationships</strong>, this role needs someone who can do both, not just one or the other.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to sell <strong>consultative, content led sponsorship packages</strong> including webinars, research reports, and content syndication rather than relying on rate cards or simple media buys.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Adaptable and commercially curious</strong>, someone who keeps pace with shifting market conditions, learns new verticals quickly, and can <strong>speak credibly to senior marketing and product leaders</strong>.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Asana or project management tools is desirable.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Benefits</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Time off &amp; flexibility</strong></h2><ul style="min-height: