<p style="margin: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 20.0pt; font-family: 'Tiempos Headline Black', serif; color: #263746;">Senior Manager, Data Science &amp; Marketing Effectiveness&nbsp; (MMM), </span><span style="font-size: 20.0pt; font-family: 'Tiempos Headline Black', serif; color: #02add0;">&nbsp;London, UK</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #555659;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Ekimetrics transforms how organizations make critical business decisions. Since 2006, we’ve been helping companies build sustained competitive advantage through AI-powered Managed Solutions. Our dual purpose is Competitiveness and Sustainability, because lasting leadership is built on both. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Our solutions are a unique combination of people and technology. We combine our Eki.Decisions platform with embedded experts in marketing, commercial effectiveness, and data science, connecting decisions across business domains to drive real, positive, scalable, and lasting impact.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">With a full in-house team and offices in Paris, London, New York, Hong Kong, and Shanghai, we commit to responsibility and frugality in AI, systematically building competitive advantage, and being loyal to our values and DNA.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Bold', sans-serif; color: #02add0;">Your responsibilities</span><span style="color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">As a Senior Manager in Marketing effectiveness, you will lead multiple high-impact programs for strategic clients, manage multi-account portfolios, and drive both business growth and talent development. You will oversee teams, ensure delivery excellence, and strengthen Ekimetrics’ market position.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">More precisely, you will:</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Regular', sans-serif; color: #263746;"><br>Strategic Portfolio &amp; Project Leadership </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Lead a portfolio of strategic client projects (multi-accounts) or a major regional project under Partner supervision.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Define, steer, and monitor strategic project roadmaps leveraging Ekimetrics solutions models and standards.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Ensure robust governance: data quality, model accuracy, actionable insights, and on-time, high-value delivery.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Pilot portfolio growth, margin, costs, and ROI to meet business objectives.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Secure alignment of resources for high-quality delivery in line with Ekimetrics’ strategy.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Translate complex analytics into compelling narratives and actionable recommendations for senior stakeholders and C-suite clients.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Support clients in optimizing marketing spend, improving segmentation, enhancing campaign performance, and maximizing ROI.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Lead contributions to RFPs and pitches, reinforcing Ekimetrics’ commercial visibility.</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Regular', sans-serif; color: #263746;"><br>People &amp; HR Leadership</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Line manage multiple team members, overseeing performance, conducting regular 1:1s, performance reviews, and talent assessments, while ensuring high-quality delivery, profitability, and client satisfaction.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Lead HR and talent development initiatives, including annual talent reviews, career development planning, succession planning, and retention strategies, achieving retention of direct reports.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Mentor and coach managers, analysts, and junior staff, promoting knowledge sharing and developing team capabilities.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Recruit, align, and develop resources to build high-performing teams, retaining top talent.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Encourage collaboration, communication, and high engagement across squads.</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Regular', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Account &amp; Business Growth</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Serve as the operational and strategic point of contact for key accounts, maintaining strong long-term client relationships.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Identify cross-sell and upsell opportunities and support global account growth strategies.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Contribute to the scoping and design of new projects, ensuring business cases align with Ekimetrics capabilities.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Represent Ekimetrics externally at conferences, events, and client forums.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Track and animate realized client business gains from Ekimetrics partnership, drive a narrative of program value to account stakeholders. </span></li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Regular', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Practice &amp; Thought Leadership</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Share and document best practices across the community to promote mastery of delivery.</span></li>
</ul>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif;">Contribute to building/developing verticals, domains, or leading strategic projects locally or globally.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif;">Contribute to upskilling strategies for office teams in client management, PMO, and project leadership.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Act as an ambassador of Eki culture role-modelling Ekimetrics’ core values: Curiosity, Creativity, Excellence, Generosity, Enjoyment.</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Bold', sans-serif; color: #02add0;">Your profile</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
