</ul>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Regular', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Client &amp; People Management</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Experienced in line management, HR responsibilities, Performance reviews and career development.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Proven ability to lead multiple project teams and manage priorities autonomously.</span></li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Metric Light', sans-serif; color: #263746;">Excellent communication, storytelling, and presentation skills for senior stakeholders and C-suite clients.</span></li>
