try.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Through continuous innovation and in-house development, we redefine how vendors connect with their customers, empowering them to boost revenue, enhance user experiences, and access real-time sales and performance data. We support a broad range of technologies, from Contact &amp; Contactless EMV, Mifare, WiFi, 5G, Bluetooth, Touch Screens and more. Our state-of-the-art products have an extremely long service life, are of high quality, compliant with multiple international standards, boast great design, are user-friendly for all, multifunctional, and easy to integrate.</span></p> <br> <ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have 7+ years of professional software engineering experience, with at least 2 years in a tech lead or staff engineer capacity.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You possess strong, production-grade experience with Go (Golang) and Java for building distributed systems and microservices.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have deep expertise in JavaScript and TypeScript, with hands-on experience in Angular.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have a proven track record designing and running cloud-native systems on at least one major cloud platform (GCP preferred), alongside a solid understanding of Kubernetes container orchestration.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are experienced in building and maintaining CI/CD pipelines, applying DevOps/GitOps principles, and using Infrastructure-as-Code tooling like Terraform.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have demonstrated the ability to lead technical projects end-to-end and possess excellent communication skills to translate complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have familiarity with event-driven architectures (Kafka, NATS), GraphQL API design and security engineering best practices (OWASP