ook <em>shiny</em> across every device and environment.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Responsibilities</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Develop and maintain the front-end architecture and web applications for our innovative products.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ensure a flawless user experience, collaborating closely with graphic designers and other teams so that applications run perfectly and look visually stunning on all devices and environments.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Specify, design, build, and test (sub)systems within the boundaries of system specifications, project timelines, and budgets.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Bridge the gap between technical capabilities and the functional/commercial requirements of the organization.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Collaborate with cross-functional teams and external suppliers to ensure the timely delivery of competitive and sustainable products.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Stay continuously up-to-date with the latest trends and developments in web applications and programming languages to broaden our technological base.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">About Payter</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">At Payter, we are innovators, pioneers, and leaders in the dynamic realm of unattended/self-service contactless and cashless payment technology in a wide range of markets such as Electrical Vehicle Charging, Transportation, Retail, Hospitality, Vending, Charity, Parking, and beyond. The adaptable Payter platform accommodates a diverse range of payment technologies (NFC, EMV, ApplePay, GooglePay, etc.), international banking processes, closed-loop payment and loyalty schemes, and telemetry.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Through continuous innovation and in-house development, we redefine how vendors connect with their customers, empowering them to boost revenue, enhance user experiences, and access real-time sales and performance data. We support a broad range of technologies, from Contact &amp; Contactless EMV, Mifare, WiFi, 5G, Bluetooth, Touch Screens and more. Our state-of-the-art products have an extremely long service life, are of high quality, compliant with multiple international standards, boast great design, are user-friendly for all, multifunctional, and easy to integrate.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Examples of successful collaborations include:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">EV Charging:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Fastned, Shell, BP, Ionity, Alfen, EVBOX</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Cashless Charity Donations:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Hartstichting, WWF, Save the Children, Royal British Legion</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Food &amp; Drink Vending:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Coca Cola, Lavazza, Starbucks, Jacobs Douwe Egberts, Costa, Heineken, Maas International, Franke, WMF, Wurlitzer, Selecta</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Hospitality &amp; Public Locations:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Compass Group, Sodexo, Albron, TU Delft, TU Eindhoven</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Gaming &amp; Entertainment:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Pinball, Slot Machines, Gaming Arcades, Efteling</span></p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have strong, proven experience with HTML and CSS (this is required).</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are highly proficient in Angular (2+) or TypeScript (this is required).</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are familiar with Agile working methodologies and thrive in an iterative development environment.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You possess strong problem-solving skills and an exceptionally keen eye for detail.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have excellent verbal and written communication skills to collaborate effectively with your team and stakeholders.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">What We Offer</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A challenging role with varied work in a successful, fast-growing, and international organization.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">25 vacation days + 12 balance days per year for an optimal work-life balance.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Competitive primary and secondary benefits, including a travel allowance and an attractive pension plan.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A young and enthusiastic team of around 20 direct colleagues within an informal, no-nonsense working atmosphere.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Room for growth, with plenty of training and development opportunities.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A modern and highly accessible workplace in Rotterdam, in an environment where quality and service are always a top priority.</span></p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/payter-bv/front-end-developer-rotterdam-139918","tags":["IT"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1792290733},{"slug":"embedded-software-engineer-rotterdam-166992","company_name":"Payter B.V.","title":"Embedded Software Engineer","description":"<p>We are growing rapidly and constantly expanding our global contactless payment ecosystem. To support this momentum, we are looking for a proactive Embedded Software Engineer to take ownership of designing, developing, and implementing software for our state-of-the-art payment terminals.</p><p>In this role, you will be the driving force behind turning business needs into reality, starting by translating requirements into clear, functional designs. You will work closely with our hardware engineers and the broader technical team to build the platforms that power millions of transactions worldwide. This is an exceptional opportunity for a creative engineer who enjoys solving complex hardware-software integration challenges and wants to continuously develop their skills in a fast-paced, innovative environment.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Responsibilities</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Design, develop, and implement high-quality embedded software and drivers for our cutting-edge payment terminals across various platforms.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Translate customer and business requirements into robust functional designs.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Set up and maintain the development and build environments, ensuring a smooth and efficient engineering workflow.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Evaluate and implement new development tooling to continuously improve our software engineering processes.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Collaborate closely with hardware developers to build scalable platforms, skillfully troubleshooting and resolving any technical issues that arise during integration.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Review and assess code, ensuring high quality standards are met, including evaluating deliverables from external subcontractors.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Continuously challenge yourself to acquire new knowledge, explore new technologies, and contribute to a culture of continuous improvement.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">About Payter</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">At Payter, we are innovators, pioneers, and leaders in the dynamic realm of unattended/self-service contactless and cashless payment technology in a wide range of markets such as Electrical Vehicle Charging, Transportation, Retail, Hospitality, Vending, Charity, Parking, and beyond. The adaptable Payter platform accommodates a diverse range of payment technologies (NFC, EMV, ApplePay, GooglePay, etc.), international banking processes, closed-loop payment and loyalty schemes, and telemetry.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Through continuous innovation and in-house development, we redefine how vendors connect with their customers, empowering them to boost revenue, enhance user experiences, and access real-time sales and performance data. We support a broad range of technologies, from Contact &amp; Contactless EMV, Mifare, WiFi, 5G, Bluetooth, Touch Screens and more. Our state-of-the-art products have an extremely long service life, are of high quality, compliant with multiple international standards, boast great design, are user-friendly for all, multifunctional, and easy to integrate.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Examples of successful collaborations include:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">EV Charging: Fastned, Shell, BP, Ionity, Alfen, EVBOX</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Cashless Charity Donations: Hartstichting, WWF, Save the Children, Royal British Legion</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Food &amp; Drink Vending: Coca Cola, Lavazza, Starbucks, Jacobs Douwe Egberts, Costa, Heineken, Maas International, Franke, WMF, Wurlitzer, Selecta</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Hospitality &amp; Public Locations: Compass Group, Sodexo, Albron, TU Delft, TU Eindhoven</span></p><