</p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A flexible hybrid working environment.</span></p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/payter-bv/embedded-software-engineer-rotterdam-166992","tags":["IT"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1792290733},{"slug":"junior-data-consultant-amsterdam-182496","company_name":"LOGEX","title":"Junior Data Consultant","description":"<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Onze Missie</strong></p><p>LOGEX is koploper in data-analyse in de gezondheidzorg. Wij zetten complexe zorgdata om in heldere inzichten waarmee zorgorganisaties grip krijgen op kosten, betere behandelresultaten realiseren en sturen op waardegedreven zorg. Onze oplossingen worden dagelijks gebruikt door meer dan 80 zorginstellingen, zowel publiek als privaat, en maken het verschil in de gezondheidszorg van morgen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Jouw impact en verantwoordelijkheden</strong></p><ul><li><p>Je verhoogt de kwaliteit van onze dienstverlening door het valideren van financiële en zorginhoudelijke data.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Je communiceert met klanten over hun data-aanlevering en de oplevering van LOGEX modellen.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Je ontwikkelt je in de breedte en biedt ondersteuning aan meerdere teams en klanten als er vragen liggen met betrekking tot de kwaliteit van data.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Je signaleert en realiseert kansen om interne operationele processen te verbeteren.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Je draagt bij aan automatisering van onze operationele processen, mogelijk door inzet van AI.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Team</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Je maakt deel uit van het Financial Analytics Service team, dat momenteel bestaat uit 40 mensen met diverse achtergronden in de gezondheidszorg en data-analyse. Het team is verantwoordelijk voor het implementeren en onderhouden van onze oplossingen en benchmarks, die zowel medische specialisten als de planning- en controleteams in ziekenhuizen ondersteunen. Onze oplossingen helpen ziekenhuizen en medische specialisten bij maandelijkse rapportages over prognoses, het aanpakken van capaciteitsvraagstukken, portefeuillebeslissingen, het verbeteren van patiëntenzorgpaden en andere belangrijke strategische keuzes.&nbsp;</p> <br> <p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Jouw profiel</strong></p><ul><li><p>Relevante werkervaring: Je hebt 0–2 jaar werkervaring en affiniteit met de financiële sector en/of de gezondheidszorg.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een HBO- of WO-opleiding afgerond, bij voorkeur met een focus op gezondheid, data of economie.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Data-affiniteit: Je hebt interesse in data. Je werkt nauwkeurig, signaleert trends en spoort fouten of afwijkingen op.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Communicatie: Je kunt effectief communiceren met diverse teamleden en interne stakeholders.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Je bent resultaatgericht, werkt gestructureerd en hebt een pragmatische instelling.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Bereidheid om te leren en aan te passen aan innovatieve technologieën, tools en processen.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een proactieve benadering om nieuwe taken op te pakken en kansen te zoeken om bij te dragen.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Je krijgt energie van het verbeteren van&nbsp; werkprocessen.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Taalvaardigheden: Je spreekt en schrijft vloeiend Nederlands en Engels.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Wat wij bieden:</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Bij LOGEX hebben we één superkracht: data-analyse. Wij kiezen ervoor deze superkracht in te zetten om de huidige problemen in de gezondheidszorg aan te pakken door gegevens te vertalen naar betere zorg.&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>Een uitstekend beloningspakket (salaris, vakantiegeld, NS Business card, telefoon- en internetvergoeding)&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>25 vakantiedagen (op fulltime basis) om nieuwe energie op te doen, met de mogelijkheid om extra vakantiedagen te kopen&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een informele werkomgeving met gedreven collega’s&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>De mogelijkheid tot hybride werken&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een laptop en alles wat je nodig hebt om thuis een comfortabele en ergonomische werkplek in te richten&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Persoonlijke en professionele ontwikkeling via onze LOGEX Academy&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Toegang tot onze partner op het gebied van mentale gezondheid; OpenUp&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Regelmatig borrels na het werk en nog veel meer evenementen&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>€240 jaarlijkse health benefit</p></li><li><p>Mogelijkheid om een elektrische fiets te leasen via het fietsplan.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Klaar om mee te bouwen aan de toekomst van de zorg?</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">Je kunt solliciteren via onderstaande knop en je CV uploaden. Voor meer informatie, of als je vragen hebt, kun je contact opnemen met Wesley Schreuder op <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Ons bedrijf zet zich in voor het creëren van een werkplek die gelijkheid, diversiteit en inclusie bevordert. Wij geloven dat een diverse workforce essentieel is voor ons succes. Terwijl we blijven streven naar een werkomgeving waarin iedereen zich gewaardeerd en gerespecteerd voelt – ongeacht ras, gender, seksuele geaardheid, leeftijd, religie of andere kenmerken – moedigen wij iedereen aan om te solliciteren.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/logex/junior-data-consultant-amsterdam-182496","tags":[],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792290732},{"slug":"medior-web-mobile-full-stack-developer-utrecht-375740","company_name":"Learned","title":"Medior Web & Mobile Full Stack Developer","description":"<p style="text-align:start;"><strong>The mission</strong><br>Help build fair, engaged and high-performing teams.<br>We believe everyone deserves a fair opportunity to develop and be rewarded for the value they bring. That’s why we build software that helps organizations set clear expectations, define what a role entails, assess performance fairly, support employee growth, and make compensation transparent and explainable. From clear roles to fair rewards, all within one continuous process. Will you join us in driving this change?</p><p style="text-align:start;">Please note: for this role, it’s important that you already live in the Netherlands and are able to work from our Utrecht office at least three days a week.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>The opportunity</strong><br>As our new Medior Web &amp; Mobile Full Stack Developer, you’ll help build and improve our SaaS platform across all surfaces: mobile, web and backend. You’ll work on our React Native mobile app as we scale it into a fully independent experience for mobile-first markets. You’ll contribute just as actively to our web platform, from intuitive user interfaces in React to scalable APIs and backend services in <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="http://Node.js">Node.js</a>.</p><p style="text-align:start;">Your average week in Utrecht:</p><ul><li><p>Building and shipping new features in our React Native mobile app (around 50% of your time)</p></li><li><p>Building and shipping new features on our web platform, with React on the frontend and Node.js on the backend (around 50% of your time)</p></li><li><p>Shaping features together with product and design to improve the user experience</p></li><li><p>Working in structured weekly sprints with your team</p></li><li><p>Writing clean, scalable and maintainable code in TypeScript, React, React Native, Node.js and MongoDB</p></li><li><p>Building and improving performant, secure REST APIs</p></li><li><p>Contributing to technical discussions and architecture decisions, including our mobile strategy</p></li><li><p>Reviewing pull requests to keep quality high</p></li><li><p>Improving developer workflows, CI/CD and automated testing</p></li><li><p>Owning features from idea to deployment, across mobile and web</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;">In short: your work directly makes our platform faster, smarter and more scalable, helping our customers grow and pushing Learned to the next level 🌱</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>The team</strong><br>You’ll join a development team of 6 developers in Utrecht, working closely with 11 colleagues in Sri Lanka through a buddy system that keeps lines short. The team is led by Alex, our CTO. We’re an international company of 55 people (7+ nationalities) serving 350+ customers, increasingly at enterprise level. With the EU Pay Transparency Directive coming up, demand for our product is growing fast, and so is our roadmap.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Your growth</strong></p><ul><li><p>A clear growth path towards a Senior Full Stack Developer role</p></li><li><p>Learning every day from experienced, senior colleagues across mobile, web and backend</p></li><li><p>Hands-on experience building AI features into a product used by hundreds of companies</p></li><li><p>A personal development budget of €1,000 per year</p></li><li><p>An open feedback culture: we practice what we preach</p></li></ul> <br> <p style="text-align:start;"><strong>The musts</strong></p><ul><li><p>You already live in the Netherlands and can work from our Utrecht office at least 3 days a week</p></li><li><p>Around 3+ years of experience as a Full Stack Developer</p></li><li><p>At least 1 year of experience building production apps in React Native</p></li><li><p>Solid experience with TypeScript, React and Node.js (or comparable stacks), including REST APIs</p></li><li><p>Experience building or integrating AI features in a product (e.g. LLM features, agents or retrieval)</p></li><li><p>You enjoy switching between mobile, frontend and backend, and owning features end-to-end</p></li><li><p>You communicate clearly and confidently in English</p></li><li><p>You’re proactive, take ownership and love learning together through feedback</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><br>The nice-to-haves</strong></p><ul><li><p>Experience with MongoDB or similar databases</p></li><li><p>Experience with CI/CD, automated testing and cloud infrastructure</p></li><li><p>Experience publishing apps to the App Store and Google Play</p></li><li><p>Experience in B2B SaaS, ideally HR tech</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>The benefits</strong></p><ul><li><p>A salary between €4,000 and €5,500 gross per month (based on 40 hours, depending on experience), with room to grow</p></li><li><p>25 vacation days (based on full-time)</p></li><li><p>A pension plan (10%, of which we pay 50%)</p></li><li><p>A personal development budget of €1,000 per year (based on full-time)</p></li><li><p>A MacBook Pro and everything you need to do your job well</p></li><li><p>Travel expense reimbursement via our mobility plan</p></li><li><p>A hybrid setup: at least 3 days at the office, flexible beyond that</p></li><li><p>The option to work remotely from abroad for up to 6 weeks per year</p></li><li><p>Daily healthy lunches, Friday drinks and monthly team activities 🎉</p></li><li><p>An ambitious, international environment where we challenge each other and celebrate wins together</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;">Sounds good? 🙌 We’d love to hear from you. Who knows, we might be meeting each other soon.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/learned/medior-web-mobile-full-stack-developer-utrecht-375740","tags":["Product"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Nederland","created_at":1792290731},{"slug":"staff-software-engineer-agentic-search-runtime-amsterdam-135906","company_name":"Nebius","title":"Staff Software Engineer (Agentic Search) - Runtime","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;In a rapidly evolving world, trust in AI depends on AI agents being grounded in fresh, verified real-world data. Search is the foundation that makes this possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We are building an agent-native search platform designed specifically for AI systems rather than human users. Our product provides programmatic, low-latency, and observable search APIs that AI agents use to retrieve, filter, and reason over real-world information at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to work on the runtime systems of a novel search engine tailored for agentic AI consumption.&lt;/p&gt;
