nic execution with direct market access and third-party brokers to get the best result.</p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>The role</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">We are looking for an experienced Multi-Asset Execution Trader who has built a strong track record in institutional trading, ideally at a major international bank or brokerage. You bring deep market knowledge, an established network and a hands-on approach. You prefer to stay close to the market and the clients rather than move into a pure management role.</p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Key responsibilities</strong></p><ul><li><p>Execute institutional client orders across equities, ETFs, fixed income, FX and listed derivatives.</p></li><li><p>Decide on the best execution route and get the order done.</p></li><li><p>Use your market knowledge and network to strengthen client and counterparty relationships.</p></li><li><p>Contribute to the commercial development of the desk.</p></li><li><p>Travel to clients across Europe.</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Who you are</strong></p><ul><li><p>Extensive experience in institutional trading, preferably at a tier-one bank or brokerage.</p></li><li><p>Strong practical understanding of multiple asset classes and execution platforms.</p></li><li><p>Established network within the institutional trading community.</p></li><li><p>Hands-on, pragmatic and commercially minded.</p></li><li><p>Strong communication skills and fluent in English.</p></li><li><p>Affinity with financial markets, trading systems and Bloomberg.</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul><li><p>A unique workplace on the historic Stock Exchange floor in the city center</p></li><li><p>Working in an awesome, internationally diverse (35+ nationalities), continuously growing, and highly driven team</p></li><li><p>An organization where there is room for your refreshing ideas and to be entrepreneurial</p></li><li><p>Focus on your personal and professional growth with support through training, coaching and development sessions</p></li><li><p>Semi-annual evaluations including performance-based bonus scheme</p></li><li><p>The opportunity to broaden your network and peak your sales by attending (inter)national events and congresses</p></li><li><p>27 paid days off per year</p></li><li><p>Depending on where you live, an NS train travel card or bike lease options</p></li><li><p>Free in-house gym</p></li><li><p>Sponsored in-house lunch facilities</p></li><li><p>Regular fun team and company events &amp; the AFS Friday afternoon drinks</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;">Are you ready for a new challenge and do you want to become a member of this motivated and international team on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange? Please send your résumé through the application link. For questions, contact Teije Veenstra at <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Interview Process</strong></p><ul><li><p>1st get-to-know with the Corporate Recruiter online.</p></li><li><p>2nd Interview with Team Directors and an assessment at the office.</p></li><li><p>3rd Interview with potential colleagues.</p></li><li><p>Job Offer.</p></li></ul> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/afs-group-bv/senior-multi-asset-execution-trader-execution-services-amsterdam-364852","tags":[],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792279905},{"slug":"architecture-internship-march-2027-rotterdam-148232","company_name":"MVRDV","title":"Architecture Internship | March 2027","description":"<p><u><span style="color:#121317">Kickstart your career</span></u></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW18542820 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">MVRDV is a globally recognised architecture and urbanism practice, headquartered in Rotterdam, with offices in Shanghai, Paris, Berlin and New York. Founded in 1993 by Winy Maas, Jacob van Rijs, and Nathalie de Vries, MVRDV is dedicated to designing innovative, socially responsible, and sustainable architecture that shapes the future.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW18542820 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">As an intern at MVRDV, you’ll join an energetic, international team of over 200 professionals from more than 40 nationalities. You’ll gain hands-on experience working on ground-breaking projects, collaborate with industry-leading architects, and push the boundaries of design. If you’re passionate about architecture and eager to learn in a dynamic, creative environment, we’d love to hear from you.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW118727094 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW118727094 BCX8"><u><span style="color:#121317">Please note: We kindly request that recruitment agencies do not submit unsolicited candidates or profiles for this vacancy. We are managing the recruitment process internally and will not accept any agency terms or fees related to unsolicited referrals.</span></u></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW127035781 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW127035781 BCX8"><u><span style="color:#121317">Application Process</span></u></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW127035781 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW127035781 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">You have between now and November 16th, 2026 to submit your application.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW127035781 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW127035781 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">Interviews will take place between November 23rd and December 11th, 2026.</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW127035781 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW127035781 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">Successful candidates start on 1 March 2027!&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p><u><span style="color:#121317">Important: You must remain enrolled in an eligible university study program between the 1 March 2027 and 31 August 2027 to be considered for an internship.</span></u><span style="color:#121317"> </span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><u><span style="color:#121317">About the Design Collective</span></u><span style="color:#121317"> </span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW205029706 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">The Design Collective at MVRDV is responsible for designing innovative and sustainable buildings and structures. We work on a wide range of projects, from small-scale residential buildings to large-scale commercial and cultural complexes. Have a look </span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.mvrdv.com/projects"><span style="color:#121317">here</span></a></u><span style="color:#121317"> for some examples.</span>&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW205029706 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">The Design Collective focuses on projects in the following regions: The Netherlands, Asia, DACH, Francophone, North America, Central &amp; Eastern Europe, Taiwan and Middle-East. </span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><u><span style="color:#121317">About the role</span></u></p><p><span style="color:#121317">As an Architecture Intern at MVRDV, you’ll dive into a dynamic environment where bold ideas and quick thinking are part of the everyday. You’ll be guided by top international designers on projects and competitions, contributing to ambitious concepts, detailed drawings, and striking visualizations. Depending on your profile and experience, you’ll be considered for specific projects, regions and/or typologies.</span></p><p><span style="color:#121317">It’s an exciting opportunity to sharpen your skills, push your creativity, and get a true taste of working at the forefront of architecture.</span><span style="color:#FF0000">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><u><span style="color:#121317">What you’ll be doing</span></u></p><ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW55114061 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">Assisting with concept development and design proposals.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Producing drawings, diagrams, and 3D models.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Creating visuals and presentation materials for competitions and clients.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Joining team meetings and design critiques.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Researching materials, site conditions, and architectural references.</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><u><span style="color:#121317">What we offer</span></u></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW193018653 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Learn from Industry Leaders</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> – Join a global, optimistic, and ambitious team delivering solutions to architectural and urban issues all over the world across multiple disciplines – from design to business support.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW193018653 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Financial Compensation</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> – Receive a competitive internship allowance of €1.100 per month, plus reimbursement of your home-office commutes (NS-Business Card or KM-based).&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW193018653 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">A Vibrant Work Culture</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> – Experience a dynamic, international environment with regular excursions, parties, and team activities, including the Rotterdam Marathon and other sports.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW193018653 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Stay Healthy &amp; Active</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> – Enjoy affordable vegetarian office lunches (€4.30 per day), a substantial contribution towards your Urban Sports Club subscription, and access to OpenUp, our mental well-being platform.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW193018653 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">An Inspiring Workplace</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> – Work from a great office located in Rotterdam’s lively, central Blaak neighbourhood – just a short walk from the station.</span></p></li></ul> <br> <p><span style="color:#121317">We are looking for a </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">full-time</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> (40 hours/week) architect intern to join us </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">on-site</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> (at the office 5 days a week) from March 1st, 2027 to August 31st, 2027 for an exciting 6-month internship. More specifically, we are looking for students with:&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Strong design and CAD skills.&nbsp;</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Proficiency in Adobe Suite and solid 2D and 3D rendering abilities (please specify your experience with each software in your application).</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Ability to work well in international teams.&nbsp;</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Excellent verbal and written English; additional languages are a plus.</span><span style="color:#FF0000">&nbsp;</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Authorised to work in the Netherlands (through being an EU citizen, having a Dutch permit or working holiday permit). If applicable, MVRDV can support in the VISA application process for non-EU citizens. This is subject to meeting all the requirements of the Immigration Service in the Netherlands. Please make sure to fill in the correct details in your application. </span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Enrolled as a student for the entire duration of the internship (proof of enrolment required).</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><span style="color:#121317">Join us and gain hands-on experience in a dynamic, collaborative environment where your ideas matter and your growth is supported – whether you're in design, communications, HR, finance, or beyond.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW193018653 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">We’d love to welcome you to the team!</span></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/mvrdv/architecture-internship-march-2027-rotterdam-148232","tags":["Architecture & Design"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Rotterdam , Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792279904},{"slug":"stagiaire-marketing-nijverdal-153763","company_name":"12Build","title":"Stagiair(e) Marketing","description":"<p><strong>Volg jij een opleiding in marketing, AI, communicatie, (creative) business of een vergelijkbare studie? Heb je interesse in een focus op content of growth marketing?</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>We hebben jouw creativiteit en vernieuwende ideeën nodig! Wij zijn namelijk op